# --- Credentials ---
# These were dropped in the working tree during bring-up and are already
# installed on their real hosts. Nothing here belongs in the repository:
#   token.txt              Cloudflare Access service token (id + secret)
#   openai_key_for_hermes  OpenAI API key
#   .ingest-token          bearer for the lifelog Worker
#   .dev.vars              wrangler local secrets
token.txt
openai_key_for_hermes.txt
.ingest-token
.dev.vars
*.key
*.pem

